// STRIGA_BASEMARCH_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2011158043" "This has to be the most boring post on base."
// STRIGA_BASEMARCH_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3069118592" "I hate patrol duty."
// STRIGA_BASEMARCH_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P455341124" "I'm itching for some combat duty."
// STRIGA_BASEMARCH_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3320243107" "Archon Walmer is on a tear about tightening these patrols."
// STRIGA_BASEMARCH_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P150564599" "I wish something would happen."
// STRIGA_BASEMARCH_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1893849372" "I'll never get promoted stuck at this post."
// STRIGA_BASEMARCH_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4656058" "C-Can someone explain why we n-need to run this patrol?  My legs feel l-like rubber."

// STRIGA_BASEMARCH_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3282001893" "That's what I'm talking about!"
// STRIGA_BASEMARCH_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1891188281" "When I'm through with you, I'm looking at a big promotion!"
// STRIGA_BASEMARCH_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3764735476" "Now, this is action!"
// STRIGA_BASEMARCH_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1905267315" "Things just got interesting."
// STRIGA_BASEMARCH_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3214545608" "Incursion!"
// STRIGA_BASEMARCH_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3780763209" "Finally!  A break from the jogging!  Let's fight!"

// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P2617460891" "Watch out. Those heroes can be sneaky."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P1570465554" "Keep on the alert."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P3706267091" "I swear, I just heard something."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P2171140766" "I think there's someone here."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
