// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P2109142806" "I'm not seeing anything yet.  I'll holler when I do."
// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT_ :
"P1268572956" "A whole lot of nothing out there."

// STRIGA_CHECKPOINT_EAST_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
