// STRIGA_DAYPATROL_MEK_COAST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1934495422" "Primary Objective: Patrol for super-powered hostiles."

// STRIGA_DAYPATROL_COAST_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2129392586" "Secondary Objective: Repel invaders with maximum force."

// STRIGA_NIGHTPATROL_VAMPYR_COAST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1159877868" "I can hear the slightest sound!"
// STRIGA_NIGHTPATROL_VAMPYR_COAST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1347491959" "This transformation is wonderful!"
// STRIGA_NIGHTPATROL_VAMPYR_COAST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P353631261" "I hear there are some new recruits on the tables."
// STRIGA_NIGHTPATROL_VAMPYR_COAST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P567932209" "There were a few casualties among the new candidates."
// STRIGA_NIGHTPATROL_VAMPYR_COAST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3134011954" "I can see for miles, even in this darkness!"
// STRIGA_NIGHTPATROL_VAMPYR_COAST_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2270768629" "I feel so alive!"

// STRIGA_NIGHTPATROL_COAST_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1298752669" "I will prove my new strength!"
// STRIGA_NIGHTPATROL_COAST_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P358875462" "I feel like a hunter who scents his prey!"
// STRIGA_NIGHTPATROL_COAST_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3554028764" "For Nosferatu!"
// STRIGA_NIGHTPATROL_COAST_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P68671715" "Worship the vampyri!"
// STRIGA_NIGHTPATROL_COAST_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1909036295" "Quail before my might!"
// STRIGA_NIGHTPATROL_COAST_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P934303621" "I have more than enough power to deal with you!"

// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3077974390" "Ballistics? Check. Accelerant? Check."
// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3292204901" "What do we need with gears this big, anyway?"
// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4025825909" "That's a whole lot of steel."
// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3979064979" "If the Family makes trouble, you know what to do."
// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4084540098" "All this stuff is bound for Burkholder's compound."
// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2122800370" "These supplies are urgently needed."

// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P177223314" "Protect the shipment!"
// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1423554295" "We cannot lose these parts!"
// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1523688538" "I don't want to explain a failure!"
// STRIGA_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2627677398" "Stop the heroes!"

// STRIGA_DOCKPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3119748999" "Make sure everyone knows it: this is Council territory now."
// STRIGA_DOCKPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4254196960" "If we're going to own these docks, we have to take them by force."
// STRIGA_DOCKPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P756629616" "He who controls the docks has the power on Striga. Never forget that."
// STRIGA_DOCKPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2638667593" "The Family won't back down without a fight. Be ready."
// STRIGA_DOCKPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3492356338" "We've got orders to hold this area."

// STRIGA_DOCKPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3533941330" "Heroes! Everyone fight!"
// STRIGA_DOCKPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1587345980" "Remember, this place is ours!"
// STRIGA_DOCKPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P474466132" "We can't let anyone take away our territory!"
// STRIGA_DOCKPATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1979330164" "Destroy the heroes!"

// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3095343989" "I'm telling you, I'm going to need backup."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1415310559" "I'm not imagining things."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3071226860" "There is definitely someone near my post."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3638786856" "Let me talk to your superior."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P158001736" "Send more men. Discussion over."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P522786203" "Roger that.  I'll keep a lookout."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P501907175" "I repeat.  You're breaking up. Over."

// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2308071606" "I knew someone was here!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1088639870" "Great.  No time for backup."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1360468242" "We'll have to deal with this ourselves."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2950285995" "Hostiles!  Get 'em!"

// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2057495338" "This cargo is critical."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P273523154" "The Family would do anything to take back this dock."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2621584274" "I don't expect trouble."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3135196620" "People know to respect the Council by now."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2983555605" "Eye strain and carpal tunnel.  I love being the lookout guy."

// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2980000247" "Security breach!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P338667354" "There's a hero! Open fire!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3180772084" "All hands, attack!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1764424524" "We've got a problem!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSHIP_BINOCULARS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1597921248" "This looks like trouble!"

// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2268135137" "Burkholder won't accept excuses.  We have to keep his cargo safe."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3464616025" "The Sky Raiders would do anything to get their hands on this equipment."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3819334246" "This stuff is all bound for the volcano."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3510905068" "The stuff in these crates set the Council back a few mil. So keep watch."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P662649337" "This stuff is critical to the big plan."

// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2327897921" "Heads up!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2396492732" "On your guard, men!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3281251916" "Ambush!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P734667867" "Protect the supplies!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_LOOKOUT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2415145135" "Don't back down!"

// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4290650347" "I've got a delivery for the big factory here."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3166226612" "Just tell me where to go with it."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1346096141" "You want your drill bits, you're going to have to play a little nicer."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1600511315" "Burkholder's waiting for these parts.  Now, get me that clearance."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1610693905" "Look, I need those coordinates."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1326262452" "Ready to deliver. You ready to receive?"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P117191116" "We can't wait out here all day."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2459265312" "We've got a hot shipment coming in."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3735467416" "Just tell me where to send it."

// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2921261917" "We've got an ambush here!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3946624954" "Hero alert!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P418259238" "Sound the alarm!  Put everyone on alert!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P521883302" "We've got to deal with this incursion, pronto!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
