// STRIGA_AIRSTRIP_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1951316031" "Don't let me catch you slacking off."
// STRIGA_AIRSTRIP_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3815536268" "We have to show the Council we own this area."

// STRIGA_AIRSTRIP_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1717350197" "Protect the airstrip!"
// STRIGA_AIRSTRIP_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P921658358" "Let's fight!"
// STRIGA_AIRSTRIP_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2520310546" "We've got an incursion!"

// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P104708282" "You Warriors need to learn your place in the new regime!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3102661333" "Don't forget what you've learned here!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1006188699" "Had enough?"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1949167855" "This is the Council's territory now!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4123611538" "The old times are over. The Council is in charge."

// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1533297533" "You want some, too?"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P971272131" "I'll do the same to you."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_GROUNDPUNCH_ONTOP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P204986694" "You're looking to get beat."

// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1843403838" "Give them what they came for!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P823338172" "Provide them a demonstration of our might!"
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P439759334" "A lesson in respect.  That's what they need."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P931813123" "Show these Warriors who their new boss is."

// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P990953108" "We'll take care of the Warriors, after these heroes."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4054030670" "We've got a bigger problem."
// STRIGA_BRAWLSHIP_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1081089584" "Looks like everyone needs a lesson today."

// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P293856298" "We own this town now."
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2891845280" "Face it, Warrior.  The Council is here to stay."
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1807701734" "You'd be smart to stay out of our way."
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1323820961" "You can say good-bye to your teeth."

// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1141322025" "Everyone target the hero!"
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2029220774" "Uh-oh, it's the masks."
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4264002184" "We've got to change tactics here."
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1949838550" "Cast your lot with us, Warriors, and you'll live longer."

// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3140181109" "You're dead!"
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P701440964" "I'm going to mess you up!"
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1018501669" "I'm going to destroy you!"
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2949805783" "You're done for!"

// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3508790096" "Ok, time for a big battle."
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1356883223" "This should be some good action."
// STRIGA_RUMBLE_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P582844056" "I've been wanting a real challenge."

// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1638590453" "I'm telling you, we can take this area."
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2551834645" "There's no room for discussion here."
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2804688272" "We should push farther."
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4206405076" "This island is ours for the taking."
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1515690337" "All we have to do is exert our strength."
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1631026146" "We have what it takes to rule Striga."

// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2688025997" "You didn't hear anything!"
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1582566509" "You shouldn't be snooping!"
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1277495281" "I can't let you repeat what you heard."

// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P678504324" "The Council needs to be taken down a peg."
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P534549117" "The Council is pushing us. We need to push back."
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3548247180" "Things aren't looking good on this side of town."
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1228244016" "The Council's got its fingers all over my business."

// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1339666071" "You heard nothing, hero! Got that!"
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2033626479" "Hey! You shouldn't interrupt a businessman!"
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P463714413" "That was a private conversation!"

// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_WARRIORS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3589628844" "We must strike at the Council before they gather power."
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_WARRIORS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1323639323" "This is the right time to attack."
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_WARRIORS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2089157359" "The Council won't know what hit them."
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_WARRIORS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3173186552" "A true Warrior must rise to the challenge posed by the Council."

// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_WARRIORS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3784903006" "I don't like to be interrupted."
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_WARRIORS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1435666449" "That was private!"
// STRIGA_CELLPHONE_WARRIORS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4124422220" "You should keep your nose out of Warrior affairs."

// STRIGA_CHATTER_BOG_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1971269205" "I can get you a private audience with Arakhn."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BOG_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2842592075" "I can lose a few guns off the back of a supply truck."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BOG_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3787007127" "I can get you into the Cor Leonis program."

// STRIGA_CHATTER_BOG_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3413511545" "That was a private affair!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BOG_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1942371153" "I can't let you walk away now."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BOG_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2083394222" "You've heard too much."

// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1878497824" "Don't tell anyone where you got this equipment."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1119920836" "I can let you in on Burkholder's secret."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3260572627" "I think I can get you a promotion, if you've got the cash for it."

// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3507759396" "Nosy heroes are nothing but trouble!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3748593698" "I can't possibly let you leave."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1547725555" "If what I said gets out, I'm history!"

// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2741121234" "I can get you the goods."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1954266787" "I have info on the Council's latest troop movements."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P763331515" "I know the Council's weaknesses, if you're interested."

// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P317658113" "I'm tired of having my business ruined by these masks!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2101668523" "I don't want to see you around here again!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3211534559" "Striga belongs to the Family!  Heroes not welcome!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3742452302" "Don't you got no manners?"

// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_SKYRAIDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P753298709" "I hear there's a Council shipment coming through here tonight."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_SKYRAIDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4070462154" "We could take what I know, and turn it to our advantage against the Council."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_SKYRAIDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2233375486" "I've got a lead on some heavy artillery."

// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_SKYRAIDER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1638640766" "Get back, hero!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_SKYRAIDER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2698022632" "We've got a hero on our tail."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_MAW_SKYRAIDER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1622157961" "We've got to take this character out."

// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4093859159" "I can tell you how to get to the Family."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2844359344" "I know where the Warrior leaders hang out."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3085959519" "I can help you secure this area."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2751236940" "I can get you in good with the men upstairs."

// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3482609220" "We're taking Striga!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2603619181" "You can't stop the Council!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P943613892" "Give up on Striga Isle, hero! It's ours!"

// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3795843871" "I know of a Council base in the area."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4019608196" "I heard the Council is moving on the Warriors tonight."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1319775453" "I can get you some Council ordnance."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3999351846" "I hear the Council is bringing in robot parts from all over Paragon City."

// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2746521210" "Didn't your mama ever teach you it's not nice to interrupt?"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4258037304" "Hey! I've got a deal going down here!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_FAMILY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1016383700" "Get bent, hero!"

// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_WARRIORS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P607295823" "I can tell you when the Council will strike."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_WARRIORS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1206415566" "I've got the location of a Council supply depot, if you're interested."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_WARRIORS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3849853866" "I've got the goods on the Family's next torching."

// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_WARRIORS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1721900353" "This is serious business!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_WARRIORS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1061441628" "You are not welcome here!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_WARRIORS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1613402008" "I will defeat you!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_NOBLE_WARRIORS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4063485147" "Prepare for the battle of your life!"

// STRIGA_NEWSPAPER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2174278723" "Striga is none of your business!"
// STRIGA_NEWSPAPER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1190651824" "Stay off Striga!"
// STRIGA_NEWSPAPER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1048003608" "This place belongs to us!"
// STRIGA_NEWSPAPER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2197723574" "I'm going to take you down!"

// COUNCIL_ARCHON_TEASER_TEXT :
"P1322322183" "Soon, my creation will blot out the sky!"



// STRIGA_WOLFTHROATRUMBLE_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3144145276" "Repel the creatures!"
// STRIGA_WOLFTHROATRUMBLE_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1011478771" "These scum suckers picked the wrong place to look for bodies!"
// STRIGA_WOLFTHROATRUMBLE_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P938669714" "We can't have them getting into the base!"
// STRIGA_WOLFTHROATRUMBLE_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3160881456" "Hack them apart!"
// STRIGA_WOLFTHROATRUMBLE_LEADER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2765340266" "They just won't die!"

// STRIGA_WOLFTHROATRUMBLE_LEADER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1551165608" "We've got a new problem."
// STRIGA_WOLFTHROATRUMBLE_LEADER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P565216867" "Red alert! Heroes encroaching on the base!"
// STRIGA_WOLFTHROATRUMBLE_LEADER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1336295141" "This situation just got a lot worse."
// STRIGA_WOLFTHROATRUMBLE_LEADER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2019602595" "Radio for backup!"
// STRIGA_WOLFTHROATRUMBLE_LEADER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3624257569" "This isn't good."

// STRIGA_HOVERBOT_WANDER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P568717651" "Sole Objective: Maintain Council security."

// STRIGA_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P868481329" "The Council expects nothing less than the best!"
// STRIGA_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P307733018" "Work harder! You must stand up to the Council's tests!"
// STRIGA_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1750988208" "Membership in this Council isn't free.  You have to earn it."
// STRIGA_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P410345725" "I can teach you to be the Council's most effective agents."
// STRIGA_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P321664524" "If you are willing to go through fire for me, you will come out stronger."

// STRIGA_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1978371350" "Prove your skills!"
// STRIGA_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P883513546" "I want to see you in combat!"
// STRIGA_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P850014687" "This isn't a drill, men!  It's the real thing!"
// STRIGA_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1142821096" "Show me you belong in the Council!"

// STRIGA_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3931472244" "Faster!  Faster!"
// STRIGA_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3786784078" "I want to see you sweat!"
// STRIGA_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1107209733" "That the best you ladies can do?"
// STRIGA_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4041258083" "Get moving!"

// STRIGA_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1194082517" "Hurry!"
// STRIGA_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1909859692" "Move your butts!"
// STRIGA_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2357476312" "Move it or lose it!"

// STRIGA_VAMPIRE_AMBUSH_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4112574110" "I strike!"
// STRIGA_VAMPIRE_AMBUSH_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3582101374" "Cower in fear!"
// STRIGA_VAMPIRE_AMBUSH_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3834829644" "I smelled you a mile away!"

// STRIGA_CHATTER_WOLF_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P395028224" "So, Archon Janney has an opening on his squad."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_WOLF_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2185164591" "I hear that Hess has all the details."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_WOLF_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P440240183" "I hear that what's inside that volcano could level Atlas Park!"

// STRIGA_CHATTER_WOLF_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3938195821" "This is private property!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_WOLF_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3292923312" "We've got a base to defend!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_WOLF_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P727495204" "Heroes in the Wolf's Throat! Sound the alarm!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_WOLF_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P23123902" "Don't let them breach the interior!"

// STRIGA_LOITERSWAMP_LYCAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3436044670" "GRRAAAAARRRR!"
// STRIGA_LOITERSWAMP_LYCAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3719360914" "AHHHOOOOO!"
// STRIGA_LOITERSWAMP_LYCAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3913657659" "GROOWR!"
// STRIGA_LOITERSWAMP_LYCAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P94798143" "HRRRRAAH!"

// STRIGA_CHATTER_BONNY_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1071793525" "Do you believe the local legends about this place?"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BONNY_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P613810559" "I hear there are foul creatures in this area."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BONNY_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1455701292" "I wouldn't want to be out here at night."

// STRIGA_CHATTER_BONNY_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3417497828" "I like a threat I can see!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BONNY_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3622247013" "All of Striga is ours, hero!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BONNY_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P191767993" "You'd do best to back off and leave Striga Isle for good."

// STRIGA_CHATTER_BONNY_WARRIORS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2670189821" "People say that ghosts walk these hills."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BONNY_WARRIORS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1228187529" "A true Warrior is not afraid of spirits."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BONNY_WARRIORS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1994067891" "This place gives me an uneasy feel."

// STRIGA_CHATTER_BONNY_WARRIORS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P101843420" "This is our territory!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BONNY_WARRIORS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1346992306" "The Warriors will not forgive this incursion!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BONNY_WARRIORS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2883941641" "Stand and face me!"

// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDTHROAT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2404897394" "The defenses look solid."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDTHROAT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2021987312" "There'll be no incursions on my watch."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDTHROAT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3513878449" "The new troops are working out well."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDTHROAT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2246623511" "So far, nothing to report."

// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDTHROAT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2310747629" "Guards!  Defend the base!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDTHROAT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1496429572" "We've got a major breach of security here!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDTHROAT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P724996815" "We must not let the heroes pass!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_GUARDTHROAT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2007468631" "Fight to your last, men!"

// STRIGA_LOITER_LYCAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P145856048" "GRRRAAAAHH!"
// STRIGA_LOITER_LYCAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2395475409" "GRRROWWWWRR!"
// STRIGA_LOITER_LYCAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2446067549" "AYOOOOO!"

// STRIGA_BONNY_LOOKOUT_VAMPYRI_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P712497849" "I can see much farther now."
// STRIGA_BONNY_LOOKOUT_VAMPYRI_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1386050366" "Remember, we are the Council's greatest assets."
// STRIGA_BONNY_LOOKOUT_VAMPYRI_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2650300549" "There are no soldiers like us."
// STRIGA_BONNY_LOOKOUT_VAMPYRI_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3939825792" "We can easily defend this base from attack."

// STRIGA_BONNY_LOOKOUT_VAMPYRI_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P23851939" "Strike at the humans!"
// STRIGA_BONNY_LOOKOUT_VAMPYRI_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1582757741" "Disembowel them!"
// STRIGA_BONNY_LOOKOUT_VAMPYRI_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3021458603" "Rip them to pieces!"

// STRIGA_SHOTGUN_STANDGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2584963722" "I'm not afraid of the heroes."
// STRIGA_SHOTGUN_STANDGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P990028358" "The Council has more than enough might to stand up to invaders."
// STRIGA_SHOTGUN_STANDGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3718112228" "The Council has nothing to fear."

// STRIGA_SHOTGUN_STANDGUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3195935222" "Maintain the defenses!"
// STRIGA_SHOTGUN_STANDGUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3525276892" "We've got a situation!"
// STRIGA_SHOTGUN_STANDGUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2790634115" "I need everyone on these heroes, now!"
// STRIGA_SHOTGUN_STANDGUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2483604355" "There's a problem here!"

// STRIGA_COUNCIL_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4138528744" "Line up your shot."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P299495403" "Concentrate."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1071015272" "The Council demands excellence."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1192473522" "Patience.  Your skill will develop."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3972931166" "You must learn to shoot with precision."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1522495896" "Your mind is your greatest weapon."

// STRIGA_COUNCIL_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P811839005" "Show me what you have learned."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3662665954" "A test of your skills!"
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3030266803" "Act, don't react."
// STRIGA_COUNCIL_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1940488688" "Stop, think, and fire."

// STRIGA_CHATTER_BASE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1622032757" "I've got duty inside the factory tonight."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BASE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P124878050" "Hess has all the moves."
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BASE_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3026436498" "Trade you Friday night duty for Saturday afternoon?"

// STRIGA_CHATTER_BASE_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2021230512" "Hey!  Who let you in here?"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BASE_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3584221789" "Whoa, where did you come from?"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BASE_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1211436633" "You're not allowed in here!"
// STRIGA_CHATTER_BASE_COUNCIL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3640395607" "This is a serious breach in protocol!"

// STRIGA_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4122671154" "I'm just waiting for my replacement to get here."
// STRIGA_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1589309731" "Yeah, it's been quiet."
// STRIGA_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3143550786" "I'm about to call it a night."

// STRIGA_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2691706014" "Hang on! There's someone there!"
// STRIGA_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2509575628" "Looks like I spoke too soon!"
// STRIGA_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2097453358" "At least I get some action tonight!"

// STRIGA_BASE_STANDGUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3686199091" "Alarm!  Alarm!"
// STRIGA_BASE_STANDGUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2239581965" "It's an incursion!"
// STRIGA_BASE_STANDGUARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P463065083" "I've got a hero in my sights!"

// STRIGA_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1283231791" "Check.  These should be done by morning."
// STRIGA_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1654298007" "We're slipping behind schedule."
// STRIGA_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3437867274" "We're going to have to put in some overtime."

// STRIGA_WELDING_OVERSEER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1939033410" "It's a hero!"
// STRIGA_WELDING_OVERSEER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4255463235" "Protect the equipment!"
// STRIGA_WELDING_OVERSEER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3421567040" "This is going to ruin my schedule!"
// STRIGA_WELDING_OVERSEER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2034717537" "We're busy here!"

// STRIGA_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2526222194" "Those weapons had better be shiny and clean."
// STRIGA_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1400682983" "Present arms!"
// STRIGA_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P858076565" "Let's see 'em!"
// STRIGA_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P902429951" "Extra duty goes to anyone with a dirty weapon."

// COUNCIL_MEKINSPECTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2300554962" "This one's busted."
// COUNCIL_MEKINSPECTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P81064407" "This rocot is a mess."
// COUNCIL_MEKINSPECTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3510539340" "Repairing this will be a challenge."
// COUNCIL_MEKINSPECTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4012391407" "I'm going to need some new parts."

// COUNCIL_FAULTYMEK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2908890007" "Malfunction: Unit operating below accepted parameters."

// STEEL_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2189828182" "Keep an eye out for the enemy."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P558031770" "I Wish I was on vacation right now, work is such a drag."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P218281255" "I heard the heros were coming out in full force lately, we must try to keep them under control."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2578780012" "It just feels like I walk in circles some days."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4193691651" "Didn't there used to be more purse snatches going on around here?"

// STEEL_ALLHOODS_WALL_LEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2643067457" "I could really use a cup of coffee right about now."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_WALL_LEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3034638351" "Why does my replacement always have to be late?"
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_WALL_LEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P342061320" "Only 4 more days until vacation."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_WALL_LEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1016896583" "Only if Steel Canyon had more excitment, people watching gets boring after awhile."
// STEEL_ALLHOODS_WALL_LEAN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2561361693" "I love lazy days at work."

// RWZ_PORKCHOP_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4262963852" "No one gets near the base camp.  That's your order."
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P699736256" "Pork Chop Hill is our base of operations.  You want people to get inside?  Fine.  Get yourself over here and turn in that weapon."
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P439524513" "You have your orders.  I don't need to remind you to carry them out again, do I?"

// RWZ_PORKCHOP_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2546581501" "Change in plans.  Fight now!  Talk later!"
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2258354676" "We got company!"
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1703675339" "Another one for the morgue!"

// RWZ_PORKCHOP_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3472824662" "Well, do you want the good news or the bad news?"
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P758084432" "Yeah, my guys see targets coming our way.  We're getting ready."
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P141071130" "I'm going to have to get back to you.  I'm getting another one of those 'we're gonna be fighting soon' feelings."

// RWZ_PORKCHOP_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P111483774" "Gotta go.  We have company."
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3276701973" "Let's go, boys!"
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2702193173" "Time to shine!"
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1854985451" "Time to earn the glory!"

// RWZ_PORKCHOP_MEKLOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1342761714" "Objective: Repel invaders with maximum force."

// RWZ_PORKCHOP_DAYPATROL_TROOPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1773251194" "Keep your eyes peeled.  It's NEVER a quiet day in the War Zone."
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_DAYPATROL_TROOPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2184300027" "The shift is over when the sky is dark.  Stop asking."
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_DAYPATROL_TROOPS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2041876587" "I got some intel that there's some activity just over the wreckage nearby.  We're checking it out."

// RWZ_PORKCHOP_DAYPATROL_TROOPS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P45288465" "Let's move!"
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_DAYPATROL_TROOPS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1903147242" "Take 'em down!"
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_DAYPATROL_TROOPS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1331660530" "No mistakes!"

// RWZ_PORKCHOP_NIGHTPATROL_VAMPYR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1325814289" "Smell the adventure.  Let's go."
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_NIGHTPATROL_VAMPYR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1144146437" "The sky is dark and bodies are warm.  Time for some mischief."
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_NIGHTPATROL_VAMPYR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2132564604" "We can do a lot with this night."

// RWZ_PORKCHOP_NIGHTPATROL_VAMPYR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P778509738" "Adventure has come to us!"
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_NIGHTPATROL_VAMPYR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3120432230" "Let's go!"
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_NIGHTPATROL_VAMPYR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P592404264" "Time to die!"

// RWZ_PORKCHOP_VAMPIRE_AMBUSH_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4275792057" "Surprise!"
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_VAMPIRE_AMBUSH_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2786866165" "Not your night is it, pal?"
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_VAMPIRE_AMBUSH_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3617941352" "Doom!"

// RWZ_PORKCHOP_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3435826560" "Keep 'em clean and at the ready."
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1440341638" "Any misfires, it's on you."
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2662347692" "I don't care if you blow your own head off.  But your incompentence better not touch a hair on mine."

// RWZ_PORKCHOP_WEAPONCHECK_A:ERT_TEXT :
"P3538011598" "Weapons check later.  Target practice now!"
// RWZ_PORKCHOP_WEAPONCHECK_A:ERT_TEXT :
"P1291070063" "Play time's over!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P785412153" "This needs to move.  NOW."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P489148824" "I don't need to remind you that your jobs are on the line.  Move faster."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4160966544" "Which way?"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_MOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2456688358" "Where is this supposed to go?"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1339492942" "This will be painful!  For you!"
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_MOVE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2133999073" "Here we go again!"

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2582144801" "Well, it's no Striga, but I can make myself at home here."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1814391075" "All we need is the foot in the door.  Since we've got that, let's claim some territory."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1421581698" "I'm not afraid of Crey.  Not even afraid of Rikti.  Now those Blood Widows...THEY scare me."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1045608230" "We're pretty well fortified here.  I think we'll be okay as long as no one gets too close to our base of operations."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3617004788" "Let Malta and the Devouring Earth gain the attention.  When they fail, we'll step in."

// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3148384317" "Discussion later.  Fight now."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3619703975" "Break time's up."
// RWZ_ALLHOODS_LOITER_CHATTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3036840017" "I'm going to knock you into next week!"

// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2387108084" "Yes, the 5th Column is back.  And now we will wipe out the unfaithful!"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4066896932" "Join the 5th Column.  That is the only way."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P740060951" "Destroy the detractors.  We reclaim our legacy NOW!"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1511434529" "You cannot hope to prevail against us now."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2484572163" "The Council is weak, we will crush you."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3416880349" "Fools!  You didn't think we were really gone, did you?"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3841150672" "Our hour of vengeance is at hand."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P705411831" "Join us and you may be spared."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3141979681" "The 5th Column is back.  You cannot prevail."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2685932787" "I make this outfit look good."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P599807394" "Our new leader will take us to the bright future."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1645702475" "You think Striga Isle is a base of operations?  Our headquarters is in the middle of Paragon City!"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_AMBUSHBYCOUNCIL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3648860770" "You may have gained a handhold here, but we will crush you!"

// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1131643829" "Now he has no choice but to join us."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3572339341" "Point has been taken.  What are your orders, Commander?"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P299345976" "We have captured one for questioning.  Send in a specialist."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3488153802" "His vitals appear to be normal."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2264724977" "We'll bring him in right away, commander."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P663966396" "We will hold this point and wait for extraction."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4289995766" "Thank you, sir.  Glory to the 5th Column."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2623465597" "He was not a loyalist.  We were ambushed, but they were no match for the 5th Column."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3801410968" "Should we eliminate him or bring him in for experimentation?"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P764049055" "Hello?  Hello?  Someone is jamming our radio!"

// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1662481340" "Interlopers!  Attack!"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1002591991" "This one is ours, go get your own hostage!"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P671765051" "The 5th Column shall not fall again!"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3724871263" "You are too late!"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P972473343" "Sir, we are under attack.  Send reinforcements!"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P968126736" "Just a moment, sir.  This won't take long."
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2868308989" "It's a set up!"
// STEEL_5TH_ALLHOODS_WALKIETALKIE_COUNCILDEFEATED_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2191618166" "Code red!  We have a code red!"

// 5TH_CHOKEPOINT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P323230838" "Hold this position."
// 5TH_CHOKEPOINT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1421144368" "Keep an eye out for the target."
// 5TH_CHOKEPOINT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3854348095" "They have to come through here."
// 5TH_CHOKEPOINT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1859787653" "Watch your backs."
// 5TH_CHOKEPOINT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2887205668" "I've got a bad feeling about this."
// 5TH_CHOKEPOINT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1324030978" "The coast is clear."

// 5TH_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1627180857" "Soon, all this will be ours."
// 5TH_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3775255571" "It's good to be back."
// 5TH_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3973824299" "Keep an eye out for trouble."

// 5TH_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3006975550" "No problem."
// 5TH_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1300794665" "This will be quick."
// 5TH_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3395641169" "Fool!  Do not interfere with the 5th Column!"
// 5TH_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1398878676" "You just signed your own death warrant."
// 5TH_PATROL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2248267694" "Leave no witnesses."

// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_NPC_RECRUIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P212017074" "Find your true calling with Council today!"
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_NPC_RECRUIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1705761668" "Let Council welcome you into its fold!"
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_NPC_RECRUIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P718778647" "Tired of missed opportunities? Join Council today!"
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_NPC_RECRUIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2932201216" "Need purpose in life? Find yours with Council today!"
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_NPC_RECRUIT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2659770136" "Do you tire from the monotiny of everyday life? Does society force you to conform to their own mundane standards?<em>You needn't be discouraged any longer, my friends for now there is hope. Find your true potential with Council today!"

// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_NPC_RECRUIT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3731922349" "No, Not like this!"

// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_CAP_5TH_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1654269826" "NEVER!!"
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_CAP_5TH_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2030374502" "The Fith Column will never yeild!"

// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_CAP_5TH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2620147834" "This is your final warning, soldier. Renounce the Column and side with Council!"
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_CAP_5TH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3062953828" "Any last words, soldier?"
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_CAP_5TH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4257779258" "Death is the only way out!"

// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_SURROUND_5TH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3491684388" "Hmph! A wolf you may be, but try anything funny and you'll die like a pig."
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_SURROUND_5TH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1986186608" "A single-minded creature. It won't be hard to break."
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_SURROUND_5TH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P109854003" "We can retrain this one to kill for us."

// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_SURROUND_5TH_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2549793940" "No! Don't let it get away!"
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_SURROUND_5TH_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3713907814" "Forget the wolf! We have heroes in our company!"

// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_LOITER_ATTN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1192776837" "Everything is running according to plan."
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_LOITER_ATTN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P250671972" "Troops are in position, as indicated on the map."
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_LOITER_ATTN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1299313902" "We have annexed both towers, sir. The men are awaiting your next orders."
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_LOITER_ATTN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P856984363" "The Fifth Column has been toppled, sir."
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_LOITER_ATTN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1475843835" "Abyss Towers has been captured. We are ready to move in at your command."

// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_POW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1952970358" "If any of them try to escape, kill them."
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_POW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2187074984" "Kill anyone who tries to escape."

// BRICKSTOWN_5TH_POW_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1835661329" "Retreat, men! We will return with enough force to rattle the heavens!"
// BRICKSTOWN_5TH_POW_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1111154127" "The Column can never be toppled!"
// BRICKSTOWN_5TH_POW_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3123771266" "The Fifth Column will rise again!"


// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_DRILL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3450967329" "You must earn your place in the Council! The weak will be weeded out."
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_DRILL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P663773782" "You will rise to become the Council's most effective agents."
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_DRILL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2145103276" "Pressure makes diamonds!"


// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_VAMPYR_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1137179215" "A fine meal it makes!"
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_VAMPYR_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P795407530" "Just like cattle..."
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_VAMPYR_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1411609160" "Come! I thirst!"
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_VAMPYR_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P426940713" "You're powers are no match for my undying thirst!"
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_VAMPYR_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3358753253" "Yeild to me!"
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_VAMPYR_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3445610488" "There is no escape! Better heroes than you have tried!"

// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_BP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3142822222" "Very well. We move in at once!"
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_BP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P88209031" "The Council is most pleased with your efficiency."
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_BP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1311872825" "Everything is in order then?"
// BRICKSTOWN_COUNCIL_BP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2588289303" "Spare me details. Are we in position or not?"
